  "display_name": "TikTok — In-Feed Auction ad (Non-Spark)",
  "description": "Paid In-Feed Auction placement, non-Spark. Ads Manager enforces concrete numeric limits that differ from the organic upload paths.",
  "origin": "shipped",
  "ruleset_version": "2026-08-09.1",
  "last_verified_date": "2026-08-09",
  "byte_convention": "Decimal bytes (1 MB = 1,000,000).",
  "caveats": [
    "Ad limits must never be applied to organic files, or organic limits to ads. They are different products.",
    "Minimum dimensions depend on the aspect ratio: 540x960 for 9:16, 960x540 for 16:9, 640x640 for 1:1. A file whose ratio matches none of these is checked against the 9:16 floor only if its ratio is close to 9:16.",
    "TikTok's ad help pages specify containers but do not authoritatively enumerate codecs, so H.264 is treated as a recommendation.",
    "Spark Ads (Pull) inherit the organic post and carry no independent file limits; use an organic preset for those."
  ],
